<div class="modal fade profile-modal" id="member_102" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="exampleModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-xl modal-dialog-scrollable">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-body">
                <div class="row">

                    
                    <div class="col-xl-4 col-lg-6">
                        <img src="https://informinvestor.cmda.gov.mv/storage/uploads/nxqm6Noy/c/j8ktczj6-preview.jpg" alt="" class="mb-lg-0 mb-4">
                    </div>

                    
                    <div class="col-xl-8 col-lg-6 align-self-center" id="profile-info">
                        
                        <h4 class="text-primary mb-2 text-center text-lg-start">Mr. Mohamed Zuhair</h4>
                        
                        <h6 class="text-secondary fw-normal text-center text-lg-start" id="designation">Alternate Director</h6>

















                    

                            <p class="text-gray-500">
                                                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Mr. Zuhair holds Master's Degree (MSc) in Agricultural Studies from University of Queensland, Australia. In addition, he also holds Bachelor of Science (in Agriculture) and Post Graduate Diploma of Ingenieur Agricola from American University of Beirut, Lebanon. He has more than 30 years of experience at prominent positions in the Government of Maldives. He also served as a Deputy Minister at the Ministry of Fisheries, Agriculture and Marine Resources and Minister of State at the Ministry of Defence and National Security. In addition, he has served as Chairman of MIFCO, Chairman of Kadhdhoo Airport Company Ltd (KACL) and Managing Director at Fantasy Pvt Ltd.Other appointments – Chairman of Kadhdhoo Airport Company.
    </div>
</div>
                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    He does not hold any share in HDFC.<br>
    </div>
</div>
                                                            </p>

                    </div>
